00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.125
Yeah, it used the Marvel IP.

00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:08.980
And "Lineage 2" and "Blade and
Soul" is developed by NCSOFT,

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.260
but it's really popular in Asia.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:15.700
So Netmarble leveraged
these IPs to acquire

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.710
