00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:16.440
And also, he's going to give
you the solutions that Netmarble

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.250
model is currently using.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.040
So please welcome
Etsuji on the stage.

